  "Question": "Given \\(AB\\parallel CD\\), what should be used to deduce that the corresponding angles satisfy \\(\\angle 1=\\angle 2\\)?",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "Criteria for parallel lines",
    "B": "Properties of parallel lines",
